title: TLS Callback Injection
id: ab3538c6-c048-4236-8611-c35496764844
status: experimental
description: Detects thread-local storage (TLS) callback injection, where malicious code executes via a PE's TLS callbacks before the entry point; observed as a suspended-then-resumed child with a modified image (process tampering).
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/005/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_tampering
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 25
    Type|contains: 'Image'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - Image
  - Type
falsepositives:
  - Packers using TLS callbacks
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1055.005
